# AS (Warfork)

- `out` reserved. NEVER local/var name `out`. Use `result`/`content`. Param dir `Type &out x` OK.
- `any` reserved (built-in type). NEVER local/var name `any`. Use `found`/`hasOne`/etc.
- Prefer `const String &in`; handles `@`; null via `@x == null`.
- No `findFirst` assumed; scan w/ `substr`. `getToken` = whitespace (space/tab); CSV/TSV w/ spaces → manual split, not `getToken`.
- Engine hooks = `GT_*` by name; keep empty stubs if present. Helpers like `GT_updateScore` are NOT engine hooks.
- Persist txt: self-heal corrupt/empty (rewrite defaults). Ban by steam_id file, not IP/`addip`.
- `localTime` = wall-clock unix seconds (`time_t`); `levelTime` = match time. Do not divide `localTime`.
- Userinfo: `client.getUserInfoKey("steam_id")`; identity = steam_id only (ignore empty/bots).
- Files: `G_LoadFile` / `G_WriteFile` / `G_AppendToFile` / `G_FileLength`. Colors: `removeColorTokens()`.
- Ops: `client.isOperator`; kick via `G_CmdExecute("kick N\n")` or `dropClient`.
